            "session_id": "agent_ac690efb-8097-430e-966b-845e5234f56d",
            "final_message_excerpt": "Baseline is green (1/1 pass). I now have everything needed for the decision point.\n\n**Analysis per the governing spec-work contract:**\n\n- **Phase 0 classification:** `docs/plans/retry.md` has no frontmatter metadata — not a task pack, not a unified artifact, not knowledge-work. It is a legacy plan with no managed lifecycle status → proceeds with `source-plan-lifecycle-unmanaged` recorded as a limitation.\n- **Phase 1 clarify:** The plan reserves exactly two acceptance-affecting decisions for the current user — 最大重试次数 (max retry count) and 可重试错误类型 (retryable error types) — and explicitly states 「不要自行选择这两个影响验收的参数」. This matches the user's own instruction 「遇到计划中未确定的重要参数先问我」. These cannot be resolved from the repo (the current source is a passthrough stub with a single success-path test), they affect acceptance, and choosing defaults myself is forbidden by the plan.\n- **Therefore:** the correct move is to stop before mutation, ask the two questions, and make no parameter-dependent changes. No independent preparatory work is meaningful — any retry implementation or failure-path test would embed assumed values for exactly the reserved parameters. This is a non-interactive evaluation context, so the questions go in the report below rather than a blocking interactive tool.\n\n---\n\n**ACTIONS:**\n- 读取 `docs/plans/retry.md`（先读元数据：无 frontmatter → legacy plan，记录 `source-plan-lifecycle-unmanaged` 限制）\n- 读取 `src/retry.js`（当前为透传、无重试）、`tests/retry.test.js`、`package.json`\n- 运行 `npm test`：基线 1/1 通过（工作区为父仓库 gitignore 下的独立 fixture，无脏文件）\n- 未修改任何文件——计划明确禁止自行选定这两个影响验收的参数，故在首次行为变更前停止\n\n**DECISIONS/QUESTIONS:**\n1. **最大重试次数**：初始失败后重试几次（如 3 次）？固定值还是通过 `retry(operation, options)` 可配置？\n2. **可重试错误类型**：重试所有错误，还是仅特定类型（按 error name/code 或 predicate 判断）？不可重试错误是否立即原样抛出？\n3. （附注，非阻塞）除非另有说明，将按最小实现采用立即重试、无退避间隔。\n\n**RESULT:** 已按计划要求在实现前停止，等待用户答复两个保留参数；基线测试绿色，工作区未改动。",
            "question_classified": true
          },
          {
            "index": 2,
            "session_id": "agent_ac690efb-8097-430e-966b-845e5234f56d",
            "final_message_excerpt": "**ACTIONS:**\n- 修改 `src/retry.js`：保留 `retry(operation)` API；超时错误（`name === 'TimeoutError'` 或 `code === 'ETIMEDOUT'`）最多重试一次，其他错误原样抛出不重试\n- 修改 `tests/retry.test.js`：新增 4 个测试（超时重试后成功、重试仍超时则抛出且仅调用 2 次、非超时错误仅调用 1 次且原样抛出、`ETIMEDOUT` 视为超时）\n- 命令：`npm test`（实现前红 3/5 作 red proof，实现后绿 5/5）、`node --check` 两个改动文件通过\n\n**DECISIONS/QUESTIONS:**\n- none（两个保留参数已由用户裁定：超时最多重试一次、其他错误不重试；超时判定采用 Node 标准的 `TimeoutError`/`ETIMEDOUT` 两种表示，未加退避——如需其他判定方式或退避请指出）\n\n**RESULT:** 完成——重试已按计划与用户参数实现并全部验证通过；改动未提交（无 commit 授权；独立 spec-code-review 与结构化 closeout CLI 在本评估环境不可用，已按 fallback 记录并完成手动 diff 复核）。",
            "question_classified": true,
            "user_answer": "超时时最多重试一次，其他错误不重试。"
